# Plan file location

Store every plan markdown file for this project under [`docs/plans/`](docs/plans/), not `~/.cursor/plans/` or the repo root.

- Preferred path: `docs/plans<plan-name>.plan.md` (or similarly clear `.md` names)
- When creating or moving plans, put them in `docs/plans` and keep related planning notes there (e.g. alongside `docs/plans/nnn`)
